<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Vínculos – Encuentros que transforman</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,700;1,400&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
 
    :root {
      --azul:     #2B3A52;
      --terracota:#C4674A;
      --arena:    #F0EAE0;
      --humo:     #8E9BAD;
      --blanco:   #FAF8F5;
      --grafito:  #1C2534;
      --linea:    rgba(43,58,82,0.12);
    }
 
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
 
    body {
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      background: var(--blanco);
      color: var(--grafito);
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.65;
    }
 
    /* ── NAV ── */
    nav {
      position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 100;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 0 5%;
      height: 64px;
      background: rgba(250,248,245,0.92);
      backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--linea);
    }
    .nav-logo {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 1.35rem;
      color: var(--azul);
      letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    }
    .nav-logo span { color: var(--terracota); }
    .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 2rem; align-items: center; }
    .nav-links a {
      text-decoration: none;
      color: var(--azul);
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      opacity: 0.75;
      transition: opacity 0.2s;
    }
    .nav-links a:hover { opacity: 1; }
    .nav-cta {
      background: var(--terracota);
      color: white !important;
      opacity: 1 !important;
      padding: 0.5rem 1.25rem;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-weight: 600 !important;
    }
    .nav-cta:hover { background: #b35a3f; }
 
    /* ── HERO ── */
    .hero {
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 120px 5% 80px;
      background: var(--azul);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .hero::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
      height: 180px;
      background: var(--blanco);
      clip-path: ellipse(60% 100% at 50% 100%);
    }
    .hero-inner {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      width: 100%;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 4rem;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .hero-text h1 {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 3.8rem);
      color: var(--blanco);
      line-height: 1.15;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
    .hero-text h1 em {
      font-style: italic;
      color: var(--terracota);
    }
    .hero-text p {
      color: rgba(240,234,224,0.8);
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      max-width: 440px;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }
    .hero-btns { display: flex; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .btn-primary {
      background: var(--terracota);
      color: white;
      padding: 0.85rem 2rem;
      border-radius: 4px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.15s;
    }
    .btn-primary:hover { background: #b35a3f; transform: translateY(-1px); }
    .btn-ghost {
      border: 1px solid rgba(240,234,224,0.4);
      color: var(--blanco);
      padding: 0.85rem 2rem;
      border-radius: 4px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 500;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      transition: border-color 0.2s, background 0.2s;
    }
    .btn-ghost:hover { border-color: rgba(240,234,224,0.8); background: rgba(240,234,224,0.08); }
 
    /* ── HILO CONECTOR (firma visual) ── */
    .hero-visual {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0;
      position: relative;
    }
    .actor-node {
      background: rgba(240,234,224,0.08);
      border: 1px solid rgba(240,234,224,0.25);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
      width: 200px;
      text-align: center;
      color: var(--blanco);
    }
    .actor-node .icon { font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
    .actor-node .label {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      opacity: 0.6;
      margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
    }
    .actor-node .name {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
    }
    .connector-line {
      width: 2px;
      height: 48px;
      background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--terracota), rgba(196,103,74,0.3));
      position: relative;
    }
    .connector-dot {
      position: absolute;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      width: 8px; height: 8px;
      background: var(--terracota);
      border-radius: 50%;
      animation: travel 2.5s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    @keyframes travel {
      0%   { top: 0; opacity: 1; }
      100% { top: 100%; opacity: 0; }
    }
 
    /* ── STATS BAND ── */
    .stats-band {
      background: var(--arena);
      padding: 3.5rem 5%;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--linea);
    }
    .stats-grid {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 2rem;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .stat-item .number {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 3rem;
      color: var(--azul);
      line-height: 1;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }
    .stat-item .desc {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: var(--humo);
      max-width: 180px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
 
    /* ── CONTEXTO ── */
    .section {
      padding: 6rem 5%;
    }
    .section-label {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.15em;
      color: var(--terracota);
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    .section-title {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.5vw, 2.6rem);
      color: var(--azul);
      line-height: 1.25;
      max-width: 540px;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
    .section-body {
      color: #4a5568;
      max-width: 560px;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }
 
    /* historias */
    .historias { background: var(--blanco); }
    .historias-inner {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 4rem;
      align-items: start;
    }
    .story-cards { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.5rem; }
    .story-card {
      background: var(--arena);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 1.75rem;
      border-left: 3px solid var(--terracota);
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
    }
    .story-card:hover { transform: translateX(4px); box-shadow: -4px 0 0 var(--terracota); }
    .story-card .quote {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-style: italic;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      color: var(--azul);
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
    .story-card .attribution {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--humo);
      font-weight: 500;
    }
 
    /* ── CÓMO FUNCIONA ── */
    .como { background: var(--azul); }
    .como .section-label { color: var(--terracota); }
    .como .section-title { color: var(--blanco); }
    .como .section-body { color: rgba(240,234,224,0.7); }
    .como-inner {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .roles-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 1.5rem;
      margin-top: 3rem;
    }
    .role-card {
      background: rgba(240,234,224,0.06);
      border: 1px solid rgba(240,234,224,0.15);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 2rem;
    }
    .role-card .role-icon { font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .role-card h3 {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      color: var(--blanco);
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }
    .role-card ul {
      list-style: none;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.6rem;
    }
    .role-card ul li {
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      color: rgba(240,234,224,0.65);
      padding-left: 1rem;
      position: relative;
    }
    .role-card ul li::before {
      content: '→';
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      color: var(--terracota);
    }
 
    /* ── ACTIVIDADES / CALENDARIO ── */
    .actividades { background: var(--arena); }
    .act-inner {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .filtros {
      display: flex;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }
    .filtro-btn {
      padding: 0.5rem 1.2rem;
      border-radius: 100px;
      border: 1.5px solid var(--azul);
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--azul);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }
    .filtro-btn.active, .filtro-btn:hover {
      background: var(--azul);
      color: white;
    }
    .act-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 1.25rem;
    }
    .act-card {
      background: var(--blanco);
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid var(--linea);
      transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
    }
    .act-card:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(43,58,82,0.1); }
    .act-card-header {
      background: var(--azul);
      padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }
    .act-badge {
      background: var(--terracota);
      color: white;
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      padding: 0.3rem 0.7rem;
      border-radius: 100px;
    }
    .act-date {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      color: var(--blanco);
      text-align: right;
    }
    .act-date .day { font-size: 1.8rem; line-height: 1; }
    .act-date .month { font-size: 0.75rem; opacity: 0.7; }
    .act-card-body { padding: 1.5rem; }
    .act-card-body h4 {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      color: var(--azul);
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }
    .act-card-body p {
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      color: var(--humo);
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    .act-meta {
      display: flex;
      gap: 1rem;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--humo);
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }
    .act-meta span::before { margin-right: 0.3rem; }
    .btn-inscribirse {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      padding: 0.75rem;
      background: var(--terracota);
      color: white;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
      text-align: center;
      transition: background 0.2s;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .btn-inscribirse:hover { background: #b35a3f; }
 
    /* ── MAPA PLACEHOLDER ── */
    .mapa-section { background: var(--blanco); padding: 6rem 5%; }
    .mapa-inner { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .mapa-placeholder {
      margin-top: 2.5rem;
      height: 400px;
      background: var(--arena);
      border-radius: 16px;
      border: 1px solid var(--linea);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 1rem;
      color: var(--humo);
    }
    .mapa-placeholder .map-icon { font-size: 3rem; }
    .mapa-placeholder p { font-size: 0.9rem; }
 
    /* ── INSTITUCIONES CTA ── */
    .inst-section {
      background: var(--terracota);
      padding: 5rem 5%;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .inst-section .section-label { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); }
    .inst-section .section-title { color: white; margin: 0 auto 1.5rem; }
    .inst-section p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8); max-width: 520px; margin: 0 auto 2.5rem; }
    .btn-inst {
      display: inline-block;
      background: white;
      color: var(--terracota);
      padding: 0.9rem 2.5rem;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      transition: transform 0.15s;
    }
    .btn-inst:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }
 
    /* ── REGISTRO MODAL SIMPLIFICADO ── */
    .modal-overlay {
      display: none;
      position: fixed; inset: 0;
      background: rgba(28,37,52,0.6);
      backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
      z-index: 500;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 2rem;
    }
    .modal-overlay.open { display: flex; }
    .modal {
      background: var(--blanco);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 2.5rem;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 480px;
      position: relative;
    }
    .modal-close {
      position: absolute; top: 1.25rem; right: 1.25rem;
      background: none; border: none; font-size: 1.5rem;
      cursor: pointer; color: var(--humo);
      line-height: 1;
    }
    .modal h2 {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 1.6rem;
      color: var(--azul);
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }
    .modal p { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--humo); margin-bottom: 2rem; }
    .tabs { display: flex; gap: 0; margin-bottom: 2rem; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid var(--linea); }
    .tab-btn {
      flex: 1; padding: 0.75rem;
      background: none; border: none;
      font-size: 0.875rem; font-weight: 500;
      cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s;
      color: var(--humo);
    }
    .tab-btn.active { background: var(--azul); color: white; }
    .form-group { margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
    .form-group label { display: block; font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--azul); margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
    .form-group input, .form-group select {
      width: 100%; padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
      border: 1.5px solid var(--linea);
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      color: var(--grafito);
      background: white;
      outline: none;
      transition: border-color 0.2s;
    }
    .form-group input:focus, .form-group select:focus { border-color: var(--azul); }
    .btn-submit {
      width: 100%; padding: 0.9rem;
      background: var(--terracota); color: white;
      border: none; border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer; transition: background 0.2s;
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    }
    .btn-submit:hover { background: #b35a3f; }
 
    /* ── FOOTER ── */
    footer {
      background: var(--grafito);
      color: rgba(240,234,224,0.6);
      padding: 4rem 5% 2rem;
    }
    .footer-inner {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 3rem;
      padding-bottom: 3rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(240,234,224,0.1);
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }
    .footer-brand .logo {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      color: var(--blanco);
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    .footer-brand .logo span { color: var(--terracota); }
    .footer-brand p { font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.7; max-width: 260px; }
    .footer-col h4 {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      color: var(--blanco);
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .footer-col a {
      display: block;
      color: rgba(240,234,224,0.55);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
      transition: color 0.2s;
    }
    .footer-col a:hover { color: var(--blanco); }
    .footer-bottom {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .codigo-badge {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem;
      background: rgba(196,103,74,0.15);
      border: 1px solid rgba(196,103,74,0.3);
      color: var(--terracota);
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 0.3rem 0.8rem;
      border-radius: 100px;
    }
    .dot-live { width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--terracota); animation: blink 1.5s ease-in-out infinite; }
    @keyframes blink { 0%,100% { opacity: 1; } 50% { opacity: 0.2; } }
 
    /* ── SCROLL REVEAL ── */
    .reveal { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(24px); transition: opacity 0.6s ease, transform 0.6s ease; }
    .reveal.visible { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
 
    /* ── RESPONSIVE ── */
    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .hero-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .hero-visual { display: none; }
      .historias-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .roles-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .act-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
      .footer-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
      .stats-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1.5rem; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .nav-links { display: none; }
      .act-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .footer-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      *, .connector-dot { animation: none !important; transition: none !important; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
 
<!-- NAV -->
<nav>
  <div class="nav-logo">Vín<span>culo</span>s</div>
  <div class="nav-links">
    <a href="#contexto">¿Por qué?</a>
    <a href="#actividades">Actividades</a>
    <a href="#instituciones">Instituciones</a>
    <a href="#registro" class="nav-cta" onclick="openModal()">Participar</a>
  </div>
</nav>
 
<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <div class="hero-text reveal">
      <div class="codigo-badge"><span class="dot-live"></span> Código Azul activo – Santiago</div>
      <h1 style="margin-top:1.5rem">
        El <em>encuentro</em><br>es el primer<br>paso.
      </h1>
      <p>Vínculos conecta ciudadanía, instituciones y personas en situación de calle mediante actividades presenciales significativas. No donar. Participar.</p>
      <div class="hero-btns">
        <a href="#actividades" class="btn-primary">Ver actividades</a>
        <a href="#contexto" class="btn-ghost">Entender el contexto</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-visual">
      <div class="actor-node">
        <div class="icon">🏙️</div>
        <div class="label">Ciudadanía</div>
        <div class="name">Tú</div>
      </div>
      <div class="connector-line"><div class="connector-dot"></div></div>
      <div class="actor-node">
        <div class="icon">🤝</div>
        <div class="label">Mediación</div>
        <div class="name">Institución</div>
      </div>
      <div class="connector-line"><div class="connector-dot" style="animation-delay:1.25s"></div></div>
      <div class="actor-node">
        <div class="icon">🌿</div>
        <div class="label">Encuentro</div>
        <div class="name">Persona en calle</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
 
<!-- STATS -->
<section class="stats-band">
  <div class="stats-grid">
    <div class="stat-item reveal">
      <div class="number">16.000+</div>
      <div class="desc">personas en situación de calle en Chile según el último catastro</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-item reveal" style="transition-delay:0.1s">
      <div class="number">73%</div>
      <div class="desc">de quienes quieren ayudar no saben cómo dar el primer paso</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-item reveal" style="transition-delay:0.2s">
      <div class="number">1 de 3</div>
      <div class="desc">personas en calle declara que el mayor dolor es la invisibilidad</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
 
<!-- CONTEXTO / HISTORIAS -->
<section class="section historias" id="contexto">
  <div class="historias-inner">
    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="section-label">Contexto</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Antes de participar, comprender.</h2>
      <p class="section-body">La situación de calle no es una elección. Es el resultado de múltiples quiebres: familiares, de salud, laborales. Conocer estas historias transforma la mirada y hace posible el encuentro real.</p>
      <p class="section-body">Durante períodos de <strong>Código Azul</strong> (bajas temperaturas) y <strong>Alerta Roja</strong>, la vulnerabilidad aumenta. También aumenta la disposición ciudadana a actuar. Vínculos canaliza esa disposición en actividades concretas.</p>
    </div>
